+/** Tokens: every `--x: v` declaration tree-wide (last wins per name; all kept in `all`), in every CSS
+ *  block, `@theme` included; (GRAPHITE) `@property` initial-values and Tailwind arbitrary properties
+ *  are declaration SITES too. */
